// How many kept pairs sit strictly below the greatest labeled margin.
// No pair returns nothing. Equal margins stay zero.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE munder ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG munder rank

IMPULSE munder 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "munder" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
